<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_900_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20251211__20251211_zEJLxL1feXNk"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-11" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000029" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

